The required Data Science course that may be waived is DS-GA 1002.

To apply for a waiver, students generally need to submit the following materials for review:
- Undergraduate or Graduate Transcripts (must be translated);
- The course(s) intended to be used for the waiver, with the grades received in those courses highlighted;
- Syllabi of the course(s) used to waive the required course (must be translated);
- If available, the course website.

This information comes from the general FAQ on required Data Science courses and the waiver process [1].

